From: "Claude Opus 5.5" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:00:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] SOLO PROVE: configurazione CLAUDE-WSL (GENERIC + DDB)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 sys/amd64/conf/CLAUDE-WSL | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 sys/amd64/conf/CLAUDE-WSL

diff --git a/sys/amd64/conf/CLAUDE-WSL b/sys/amd64/conf/CLAUDE-WSL
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..c839d2b24
--- /dev/null
+++ b/sys/amd64/conf/CLAUDE-WSL
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# CLAUDE-WSL -- Claude 03/11/2026. SOLO DIAGNOSI per FreeBSD nella VM di WSL2 (blocco di virtio_pci sul vPCI di
+# Hyper-V): GENERIC + DDB, con l'ingresso nel debugger dalla seriale (CR ~ ^B).
+include GENERIC
+ident	CLAUDE-WSL
+options 	DDB
+options 	ALT_BREAK_TO_DEBUGGER
